# Line endings.
#
# Force LF for the TypeScript backend so eslint-config-google's
# `linebreak-style` (LF) passes the functions predeploy lint on Windows
# checkouts (core.autocrlf would otherwise hand eslint CRLF files). Dart and
# other sources keep the platform default — `dart analyze` is line-ending
# agnostic, so normalizing them would only add churn.
*.ts text eol=lf
